    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a magical jar to capture colorful creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/81375bbf88f88e6976cf5b7a28ac5b8f.poster.avif?t=1754369342\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/81375bbf88f88e6976cf5b7a28ac5b8f.webm?t=1754369342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve tricky puzzles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/df6b55ef869e5637a1ccd2149c16ac40.poster.avif?t=1754369342\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/df6b55ef869e5637a1ccd2149c16ac40.webm?t=1754369342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through retro-inspired bosses and levels as young hero Toxtli battles to stop the chaos of the evil Star Lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/5c1278de1a7682bad5c4645a36416fee.poster.avif?t=1754369342\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/5c1278de1a7682bad5c4645a36416fee.webm?t=1754369342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a magical jar to capture colorful creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/81375bbf88f88e6976cf5b7a28ac5b8f.poster.avif?t=1754369342\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/81375bbf88f88e6976cf5b7a28ac5b8f.webm?t=1754369342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve tricky puzzles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/df6b55ef869e5637a1ccd2149c16ac40.poster.avif?t=1754369342\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/df6b55ef869e5637a1ccd2149c16ac40.webm?t=1754369342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through retro-inspired bosses and levels as young hero Toxtli battles to stop the chaos of the evil Star Lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/5c1278de1a7682bad5c4645a36416fee.poster.avif?t=1754369342\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538340/extras/5c1278de1a7682bad5c4645a36416fee.webm?t=1754369342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
